{"lesson":{"id":"dl_mwn2h7uvwuq62","courseId":"dl_mwn2h7w0a4ehr","order":14,"title":"Was trinkst du?","nativeTitle":"What Are You Drinking?","focus":"","level":"","fromLang":"English","toLang":"German","targetLanguage":"de-DE","nativeLanguage":"en-US","speakers":["Nico","Nina","Sebastian","Lisa","Alle"],"speakerGenders":{"Nico":"male","Nina":"female","Sebastian":"male","Lisa":"female"},"sentences":[{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Das ist Yara.","native":"This is Yara."},{"speaker":"Nina","target":"Ja, sie ist hübsch.","native":"Yes, she's pretty."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Sie lebt in Deutschland.","native":"She lives in Germany."},{"speaker":"Sebastian","target":"Wohnt sie hier in der Stadt?","native":"Does she live here in the city?"},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Aber wo ist das? Kennt ihr Yaras Fahrradladen ?","native":"But where is that? Do you know Yara's bicycle shop?"},{"speaker":"Sebastian","target":"Nein.","native":"No."},{"speaker":"Nina","target":"So. Was möchtet ihr trinken?","native":"So. What would you like to drink?"},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Was gibt es denn?","native":"What is there?"},{"speaker":"Nina","target":"Wir haben … Apfelsaft , Wasser , Bier , Wein , Cola und Limonade .","native":"We have … apple juice, water, beer, wine, cola and lemonade."},{"speaker":"Sebastian","target":"Also, ich nehm ein Bier.","native":"Well, I'll have a beer."},{"speaker":"Nina","target":"Wir haben auch Kaffee und Tee im Angebot …","native":"We also have coffee and tea on offer …"},{"speaker":"Sebastian","target":"Bier, danke.","native":"Beer, thanks."},{"speaker":"Nina","target":"Alles klar.","native":"All right."},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Für mich bitte einen Kaffee.","native":"A coffee for me, please."},{"speaker":"Nina","target":"Mit Milch und Zucker ?","native":"With milk and sugar?"},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Ja, mit viel Milch, aber wenig Zucker. Ah warte, ich mach das.","native":"Yes, with lots of milk but little sugar. Ah, wait, I'll do it."},{"speaker":"Nina","target":"Was ist mit dir, Nico? Hast du auch Durst? Was möchtest du trinken?","native":"What about you, Nico? Are you thirsty too? What would you like to drink?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Cola bitte.","native":"Cola, please."},{"speaker":"Nina","target":"Alles klar. Dann nehme ich Limonade.","native":"All right. Then I'll have lemonade."},{"speaker":"Sebastian","target":"Also, Freunde, ich hab ’ne Idee! Wir … wir posten das Foto von Yara bei Book und fragen : Wer kennt diesen Fahrradladen? Und so finden wir die Adresse raus.","native":"Okay, friends, I have an idea! We … we post the photo of Yara on Book and ask: Who knows this bicycle shop? And that's how we find out the address."},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Ja, vielleicht.","native":"Yes, maybe."},{"speaker":"Nina","target":"Habt ihr Hunger?","native":"Are you hungry?"},{"speaker":"Lisa","target":"Hunger? Hungry?","native":"Hunger? Hungry?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Ja!","native":"Yes!"},{"speaker":"Nina","target":"Hier.","native":"Here."},{"speaker":"Nina","target":"Hier sind die Speisekarten !","native":"Here are the menus!"},{"speaker":"Sebastian","target":"So, also dann prost!","native":"So, well then, cheers!"},{"speaker":"Alle","target":"Prost!","native":"Cheers!"},{"speaker":"Sebastian","target":"Wo ist denn Nawin? Ist er nicht hier?","native":"Where is Nawin, anyway? Isn't he here?"}],"teach":null,"wordData":null,"progress":{"teach":false,"full":false,"practice":null},"createdAt":1795063529479,"updatedAt":1795063529520},"course":{"id":"dl_mwn2h7w0a4ehr","name":"Nicos Weg","level":"","from":"","to":"German","createdAt":1795063529520,"custom":true},"pack":{"v":1,"lines":{"0":{"f":"Das ist Yara.","fn":"This is Yara."},"1":{"f":"Ja, sie ist hübsch.","fn":"Yes, she's pretty."},"2":{"f":"Sie lebt in Deutschland.","fn":"She lives in Germany."},"3":{"f":"Wohnt sie hier in der Stadt?","fn":"Does she live here in the city?"},"4":{"f":"Aber wo ist das? Kennt ihr Yaras Fahrradladen ?","fn":"But where